@gateway = https://localhost:5000
@token = {{$processEnv RADISH_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@postId = 1
@commentId = 1

### 赞赏帖子；需先显式启用 Forum.ContentReward.Enabled，响应丢失重试必须复用同一 idempotencyKey
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/ContentReward/Create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetType": "Post",
  "targetId": {{postId}},
  "reasonCode": "Helpful",
  "idempotencyKey": "content-reward:replace-me-post"
}

### 查询帖子的公开赞赏记录
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/ContentReward/GetTargetRewards?targetType=Post&targetId={{postId}}&pageIndex=1&pageSize=20

### 批量查询帖子与评论赞赏状态；匿名请求的 viewerRewarded 固定为 false
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/ContentReward/GetTargetStates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targets": [
    {
      "targetType": "Post",
      "targetId": {{postId}}
    },
    {
      "targetType": "Comment",
      "targetId": {{commentId}}
    }
  ]
}
